     1	# Defining relations of nonsymmetrizable Kac–Moody algebras
     2	
     3	**The full book conjecture remains unsolved in this dossier.** The work below gives a proved infinite boundary family, an exact graded comparison algorithm, and bounded rational computations; none is substituted for the universal goal. No novelty claim is made for consequences of established symmetrizable theory.
