    44	### (c) Fully formal target and fixed experiment model
    45	
    46	For every n>=1 and every integer matrix A with a_ii=2, a_ij<=0 for i!=j, and a_ij=0 iff a_ji=0, let ell=rank A. Over **C**, take the book's full realization: a rank-n matrix C with 2n-ell rows whose first n rows are A, independent Cartan generators h_1,...,h_(2n-ell), and
    47	
    48	    [e_i,f_j]=delta_ij h_i,  [h_p,h_q]=0,
    49	    [h_p,e_i]=c_pi e_i,     [h_p,f_i]=-c_pi f_i.
